@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size: 2rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p style="color:#9ca3af;">
    Willow respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.
</p>

<h4 style="color:#f9fafb; margin-top:24px;">Information We Collect</h4>
<ul style="color:#9ca3af;">
    <li>Name and email address</li>
    <li>Account credentials</li>
    <li>Financial transactions</li>
    <li>Savings and budgeting information</li>
    <li>Financial goals and expense splits</li>
</ul>

<h4 style="color:#f9fafb; margin-top:24px;">How We Use Your Information</h4>
<p style="color:#9ca3af;">
    The collected information is used only to provide the functionality of the application,
    including transaction management, savings tracking, budget monitoring, and goal management.
</p>

<h4 style="color:#f9fafb; margin-top:24px;">Data Security</h4>
<p style="color:#9ca3af;">
    Passwords are protected using secure hashing mechanisms provided by ASP.NET Identity.
    Access to user data is restricted to authorized application processes.
</p>

<h4 style="color:#f9fafb; margin-top:24px;">Account Deletion</h4>
<p style="color:#9ca3af;">
    Users may permanently delete their account. When an account is deleted,
    associated financial records, goals, savings, and split data are removed from the system.
</p>

<h4 style="color:#f9fafb; margin-top:24px;">Contact</h4>
<p style="color:#9ca3af;">
    If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at example.email@example.com.
</p>
